{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118794","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118794/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118794/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118794/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118794","id":4299134349,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABAD-VjQ","number":118794,"title":"Drag preview ignores z-index when two draggable Control nodes overlap","user":{"login":"rodeoclown","id":4734099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzQwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4734099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown","html_url":"https://github.com/rodeoclown","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1732720779,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxNzMyNzIwNzc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gui","name":"topic:gui","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":4,"created_at":"2026-04-20T22:51:36Z","updated_at":"2026-04-22T11:13:48Z","closed_at":"2026-04-22T11:10:56Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in v4.7.dev3.mono.official [60fff00a6]\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.dev3.mono - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 Super (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.8195) - Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-10700 CPU @ 2.90GHz (16 threads) - 63.76 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen two draggable Control nodes (e.g., cards in a solitaire game) overlap, initiating a drag captures whichever node was added to the drag manager later (via `_get_drag_data()` or `set_drag_forwarding()`), rather than which has the higher z-index.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nCreate two Control nodes of some description\nAssign a script to both with code like:\n```\nfunc _get_drag_data(_pos):\n\tset_drag_preview(self.duplicate())\n\treturn self\n```\nPosition both nodes so they overlap and set the z-indexes such that the node created first has the higher z-index (so it shows above the node created second).\n\nRun the scene and click and drag from the overlapped portion of the nodes.\n\nThe node with the lower z-index has dragging initiated from beneath the other node, rather than the higher z-index node beginning to drag.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[DragIgnoresZIndexDemo.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/26913513/DragIgnoresZIndexDemo.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"rodeoclown","id":4734099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MzQwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4734099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown","html_url":"https://github.com/rodeoclown","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rodeoclown/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118794/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118794/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}